NEARS-2250 delta re-QA, fix-cycle 3 (NEARS-2490 fix verification)
Device: emulator-5560. Wire capture via ad-hoc QA reverse proxy
(scripts/qa-tools-style, port 8090 -> 127.0.0.1:8000), app launched with
--dart-define=API_HOST=10.0.2.2:8090. Full raw log: delta3-fix2490-wire-capture-full.log

Repro: account A (customer@nears.com) selects module 2 (Food & Restaurant),
logs out, account B (qa.singlestore@nears.com) logs in fresh -- watch B's
FIRST cart/list call header. Repeated the cycle A<->B multiple times.

Timeline (auth/login + cart/list only):
